In this project I build a website using only HTML, CSS and JavaScipt.

User can use on different decives.

User can go through navigation.

Theme mode is implemented so user can use both dark mode and light mode.

Form is validate and has error messages.

When users send message they can see "Demo only. Your message has not been sent.".

Important !
I use AI for category filter and validation. Also for dark theme and light theme. But I write some code and some code are copy. Which mean I use them as reference because I am trying to understand how I can implement those features.
